		{"id":"bdefb1c449be4b42","type":"text","text":"**Controlled evaporator**\n\nLiquid → gas vapor, **no aerosol**\nChemical-specific temperature.\nPassivated stainless / PTFE path.","x":1800,"y":-350,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e35d69a65c03463a","type":"text","text":"**Small vapor buffer**\n\nValidate smoothing, recovery and settling time.","x":1800,"y":-110,"width":280,"height":150,"color":"6"},
